<section id="architecture" class="local-unifiedgrader-help-part">
<header class="local-unifiedgrader-help-part-head">
    <p class="local-unifiedgrader-help-kicker"><i class="fa fa-code" aria-hidden="true"></i> For developers</p>
    <h2>How it is built</h2>
    <p>Notes for developers and integrators. You do not need any of this to mark or to run the plugin. Each topic opens when you click it.</p>
</header>

<details class="local-unifiedgrader-help-details" id="dev-adapters">
    <summary>Adapters: one screen, four activity types</summary>
    <div>
        <p>The interface never talks to an activity directly. Each activity type is wrapped by an
        adapter that presents its data in one shape. Supporting another activity type means adding
        an adapter and registering it in <code>adapter_factory</code>.</p>
