            <code>adapter_factory</code> to the adapter for the activity being marked.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p><code>\local_unifiedgrader\adapter\base_adapter</code> defines, among others:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><code>get_activity_info()</code>: name, type, dates, maximum grade, grading method, feature flags.</li>
            <li><code>get_participants(array $filters)</code>: the student list with status, submission time, grade, late and override flags.</li>
            <li><code>get_submission_data(int $userid)</code> and <code>get_submission_files(int $userid)</code>: what the preview shows.</li>
            <li><code>get_grade_data(int $userid)</code> and <code>save_grade(...)</code>: grade, feedback and advanced grading.</li>
            <li><code>supports_feature(string $feature)</code>: rubric, marking guide, online text, file submission, blind marking, annotations, plagiarism.</li>
            <li><code>is_grade_released(int $userid)</code>, <code>get_late_reference_time()</code> and <code>calculate_late_penalty()</code>.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</details>

