<details class="local-unifiedgrader-help-details" id="dev-saving">
    <summary>Saving: auto-save, the offline queue and typing during a save</summary>
    <div>
        <p>Every editable field is tracked. Leaving a field starts a 1.5 second timer, then one save
        goes out through <code>local_unifiedgrader_save_grade</code>. A second save cannot start while
        one is in flight. Failed saves wait in <code>SaveQueue</code>, backed by IndexedDB, and are retried.</p>
